ies":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","review_id":"qyZf4aeDxiQh7u9Fw8MMWg","date":"2019-12-14T06:33:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9295297861099243,"text_excerpt":"Many tvs at the bar to watch a game of your choice. And a very good selection of bar food, a great place right around the corner from the best pool in all.of New Orleans. As a new owner in the upper 9th, I will definitely frequent this establishment. Not to mention the bartenders have the heavy new orleans pour well all know and love. In my rotation for sure!"},{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","review_id":"YOUglhFY4ywp1TriBkkqjg","date":"2015-07-22T19:00:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253549575805664,"text_excerpt":"This is a cool spot. There are a lot of nice and friendly people here and it was easy to find space at the bar. The reason for this review is the awesome juke box. I was in the mood to play an \"old fashioned\" juke box (that means not an internet jukebox) and a friend suggested this place. The juke is pretty inexpensive and has a lot of good songs on it. I chose to play a lot of Louis Prima because it was just that kind of night. A regular here mentioned to me that this is the place to be for Saints games, so I will have to come back and check the place out when the season starts."},{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","review_id":"_Lz18G7UU5n_kF_pA3Jrkg","date":"2010-10-12T12:58:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9247937798500061,"text_excerpt":"Classic neighborhood bar in Bywater. Was there last week with a dozen guys from work and it was a great place to hang out. Very local customer base but all are welcome. Great selection of both bottle and tap beer, full bar, lots of large TV's, and a couple game tables. I imagine a great place to wander a block to after lunch or dinner at Elizabeth's."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","photo_id":"WN_bx870YNIIphT4SX8yAw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WN_bx870YNIIphT4SX8yAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9178743958473206},{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","photo_id":"iNZN_jyhW0q0apV1Ot5BAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iNZN_jyhW0q0apV1Ot5BAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8524522185325623},{"business_id":"Cm_l5Zp_5ahUrzz3cifdgQ","photo_id":"45xiVGtqKCGBte-VaD6BAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/45xiVGtqKCGBte-VaD6BAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7861387729644775}]},"notebook_case":null}
